sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant IS as Items Service
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant NS as Notifications
    participant CMS as CMS Adapter
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant WMS as WMS Adapter

    note over Client, WMS: 1 — Browse Inventory
    Client->>GW: Browse Items
    GW->>IS: get items
    IS-->>GW: Items request queued
    GW-->>Client: Items request queued
    IS-->>WMS: request items
    WMS-->>IS: items list
    IS-->>NS: notify client with items
    NS-->>Client: WS items_response { items }

    note over Client, WMS: 2 — Create Order
    Client->>GW: Place Order { itemList }
    GW->>OS: create order { itemList }
    OS-->>GW: Order creation initiated
    GW-->>Client: Order creation initiated
    OS-->>CMS: create order { clientId, itemList }
    CMS-->>PS: order created { orderId, itemList }
    PS-->>NS: notify payment intent created
    NS-->>Client: WS payment_intent_created { orderId, clientSecret }

    note over Client, WMS: 3 — Confirm Order
    Client->>GW: Confirm Order { orderId, paymentToken }
    GW->>OS: confirm order
    OS-->>GW: Order confirmation initiated
    GW-->>Client: Order confirmation initiated
    OS-->>CMS: update order status to order_confirmed
    CMS-->>OS: order status updated
    OS-->>WMS: reserve items { orderId, itemList }

    alt All items in stock
        WMS-->>OS: reservation confirmed
        OS-->>PS: charge payment { orderId, paymentToken }

        alt Charge succeeds
            PS-->>OS: payment completed
            OS-->>NS: notify payment completed
            NS-->>Client: WS payment_completed { orderId }
            OS-->>CMS: update order status to pending_delivery
            OS-->>WMS: update delivery status to ready_for_pickup

        else Charge declined
            PS-->>OS: payment failed
            OS-->>WMS: release reserved items
            OS-->>NS: notify payment failed
            NS-->>Client: WS payment_failed { orderId }
        end

    else Item unavailable or out of stock
        WMS-->>OS: reservation failed
        OS-->>NS: notify reservation failed
        NS-->>Client: WS reservation_failed { orderId }
    end
